            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\n\nIt works fine if `nvim` is started without arguments and with some sort of dashboard (like 'mini.starter'). The file is meant as a demo of features and not as a comprehensive guide on how to use specific plugins.\n\nThe use case of starting like `nvim -- path/to/file` indeed does not always work, but it will be adjusted in the planned separate config example (i.e. \"distro\" / \"kickstart\" like project).",
